sequenceDiagram
    actor Op as Operator
    participant HM as Heimdall Console
    participant FU as Fusion Engine
    participant MI as Mimir (GLM 5.2)
    participant OF as Object Fabric
    participant EX as External feeds
    EX-->>FU: streaming feeds (sensor/data)
    FU->>OF: correlate into objects/tracks
    Op->>HM: open operational picture
    HM->>FU: query fused view
    HM->>MI: summarise / rank / recommend COA
    MI->>OF: OAG grounding
    OF-->>MI: entities + relationships
    MI-->>HM: ranked options + rationale
    Op->>HM: select action (human-gated)
    HM->>OF: write decision (sealed, audited)